---
<div class="hero">
      <div class="ghost" id="ghost" aria-hidden="true">SHIBILA</div>
      <div class="hero-grid">
        <div>
          <p class="tag">&gt; Cloud Engineer</p>
          <h1>Serverless, containers, and the <em class="scr">pipeline<svg viewBox="0 0 200 14" aria-hidden="true"><path pathLength="1" d="M3 9 C32 2 62 12 100 6 S168 3 197 8"/></svg></em> that ships them.</h1>
          <p class="pitch">I build and deploy workloads on AWS with Terraform and GitHub Actions. Before cloud, two years on an enterprise platform for <strong>Technip Energies</strong>, owning features from design to production support. Now finishing a Master of IT at <strong>Monash</strong> and mentoring 100+ students.</p>
          <div class="cta">
            <a class="btn primary" href="#demo">Break the pipeline</a>
            <a class="btn" href="#work">See the work</a>
            <div class="seal" role="img" aria-label="AWS Certified Cloud Practitioner"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 120"><defs><path id="sealPath" d="M60,60 m-45,0 a45,45 0 1,1 90,0 a45,45 0 1,1 -90,0"/></defs><g class="spin"><text class="ring"><textPath href="#sealPath" textLength="280" lengthAdjust="spacing">AWS CERTIFIED / CLOUD PRACTITIONER / </textPath></text></g><circle class="core" cx="60" cy="60" r="27"/><text class="lam" x="60" y="70" text-anchor="middle">&#955;</text></svg></div>
          </div>
          <div class="facts">
            <span class="fact"><b>AWS Certified</b> Cloud Practitioner</span>
            <span class="fact"><b>Master of IT</b> Monash, 2026</span>
            <span class="fact"><b>Full work rights</b> in Australia</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="map card full" id="mapCard">
          <div class="note">Pick a project. The map lights up what it ran on.</div>
          <div class="seg" id="lens" role="group" aria-label="Project lens">
            <button type="button" data-l="all" aria-pressed="true">All</button>
            <button type="button" data-l="neuro" aria-pressed="false">NeuroGuide</button>
            <button type="button" data-l="bird" aria-pressed="false">BirdTag</button>
            <button type="button" data-l="pose" aria-pressed="false">Pose</button>
            <button type="button" data-l="fee" aria-pressed="false">FeePrint</button>
          </div>
          <p class="row-l">Toolchain</p>
          <div class="tool" id="tool"></div>
          <div class="grid" id="grid"><svg id="edges" aria-hidden="true"></svg></div>
          <div class="readout" id="readout" aria-live="polite"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
